# Examples

Demonstrate the public API only — no duplicated business logic.

```csharp
var session = await separator.CreateSession(inputPath);
foreach (var task in session.Tasks)
    task.SetProgressCallback(...);
var result = await session.RunAsync();
await result.WriteToDirectoryAsync(outputDir, writer);
```

Persistence is always in the example, never inside the separator.
